Extends the adjusted GEE prediction of Hui, Muller and Welsh (2025) from independent clustered longitudinal data to the case of a species archetype GEE model fitted by \code{\link[=SAGEE]{SAGEE()}}, potentially with a spatial working correlation matrix/set of matrices.
